## 1. System Architecture

AURA (**Autonomous Unified Representative Agent**) is an autonomous AI call assistant engineered to represent users when they are unavailable, commuting, or in deep focus. Unlike passive voicemail recorders or rigid auto-attendants, AURA dynamically engages callers in multi-turn voice conversations, classifies intent in real time, strictly grounds interview questions in verified resume credentials, safeguards personally identifiable information (PII), and escalates critical emergencies requiring authenticated PIN dismissal.

