   * Build React 18 interface with Tailwind CSS layout and navigation.
   * Integrate browser Web Speech API for low-latency client speech synthesis and recognition.
   * Implement client-side autonomous engine (`safeguardEngine.ts`, `resumeKnowledge.ts`, `api.ts`) to enable full offline/static demonstration without backend dependencies.

5. **Phase 5 — Testing, Validation & Multi-Cloud Packaging:**
